R2.A · Lawyer case-Repository tab simplified
  Non-DIO actors see only Attached items + a compact 'stored vs needed'
  summary (green/amber/red counts from case evidence points).  The full
  catalogue view, Available-from-evidence-collection source cards, and
  audit trail remain visible for DIO actors — they need the orientation.
  Actor detected via team === 'legal' check.

R2.B1 · Portfolio matrix + Actionable pull queue widgets removed from
  dio.html.  Both duplicated existing Cases and Requests surfaces.  The
  Recent activity widget is promoted to full-width (w-12) in the freed
  slot.  renderMatrix guarded to no-op if its DOM host is absent (kept
  in-code for optional reintroduction later).

R2.B2 · Requests forum with unassigned / working / worked states
  Communal Requests widget rebuilt with proper status states + assign
  controls.  Filter chips: All / Unassigned / Working / Worked / My area
  only / Overdue.  Every request row shows a status pill + assignee name.
  Row actions: 'Claim' (unassigned -> working, assigns to active DIO),
  'Mark worked' (working -> worked, only for the assignee), 'Open' (for
  anyone to review).  State persisted to sessionStorage['dfa_dio_req_status'].

R2.BC · Territory-shaded disruption map rebuilt
  Replaces the previous flat seeded map with a proper territory-first
  view: coloured polygon overlay for the DIO's countries (UK+IE navy,
  France indigo, Iberia red), airport pins for every airport in the
  territory with workload-coloured badges (green quiet · amber active ·
  red urgent) showing open-cases + live-disruption counts, hover-
  expansion tooltips showing case list + linked disruptions per airport,
  and the 8-kind disruption overlay with per-kind filter chips.
  Structured for FR24 API plug-in later via EVENT_ADAPTERS.fr24 seam.
  Airport coordinates and country polygons defined inline for the 30
  airports across the three territories.

R2.D · Evidence Hub folded into Repository as Live Evidence
  New Live Evidence tab on repository.html.  Renders the 8-source
  browse view previously provided by evidence.html.  evidence.html is
  now a redirect stub to repository.html#live-evidence.  URL hash
  handler on repository.html honours #live-evidence to open the tab on
  landing.  DIO tools launcher tile updated to point at the new
  Live Evidence view.

R2.E · DIO Cases mirror of lawyer request flow
  Floating 'Raise request' FAB added to dio-case.html.  Opens the same
  two-path modal used by lawyers (Quick tick-box catalogue from the
  16-item catalogue + Freeform textarea).  Submissions write to the
  case's evidenceRequests store so both DIOs and solicitors see them in
  the shared Requests forum.

Cache-bust: s13a across the four touched HTMLs.
