+      <label>Describe the document</label>
+      <textarea id="dio-req-freeform-text" placeholder="e.g. Cabin-crew statement forms + FRMS extract for HC 1184 crew, 14 March 2026"></textarea>
+      <div class="dio-req-note">Freeform requests fire straight into the Requests forum with an 'unassigned' status for another DIO or the current DIO to claim.</div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="dio-req-footer">
